      "redemption": {
        "redemptionType": "NONE",
        "specialInstructions": "What Do I Need to Know?\nPlease arrive at least 15 minutes before your scheduled flight to allow for paperwork and a safety briefing. Late arrivals may face shortened flight times or a $100 re-booking fee.\nTips for pilots and staff are not included in the tour cost and are given at your discretion.\nThere are no specific dress code requirements for passengers on one of our scenic tours.\nFor individuals who have purchased an introductory demo flight, please wear closed-toed shoes.\n\nCheck-in Process\nPlease ensure you have a valid Government Photo ID matching the booking details.\n\nImportant Notes\nFor safety reasons, we reserve the right to refuse service to any passenger who is showing signs of intoxication. In such cases, refunds will not be provided.\nIn the case of adverse weather or FAA restrictions, tour routes may need to be adjusted. In the case of these conditions, Anthelion Helicopters will inform you with as much notice as possible of any changes and offer a flight reschedule at no additional charge."
      },
      "travelerPickup": {
        "pickupOptionType": "MEET_EVERYONE_AT_START_POINT",
        "allowCustomTravelerPickup": false
      }
    },
    "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles",
    "description": {
      "text": "Sunset, dusk and nighttime are three incredible times to see Downtown Los Angeles and its surroundings. Incredible lights and sunsets abound will make your journey one to remember! LA sunsets with the iconic downtown LA skyline are a view that you'll never forget as you may even see the Hollywood sign and a complete panorama of LA on clear sunsets. See the massive US Bank Building, the home of the Lakers, the Disney Concert Hall, LA Live and many other cool sites as you travel it comfort. Be sure to bring your camera!"
    },
